+  /// Includes big Approve/Deny "buttons" in the HTML part, each a mailto:
+  /// link that pre-fills a reply with just "APPROVE [ref:N]" / "DENY [ref:N]"
+  /// — so the partner taps a button, then Send, instead of typing a reply
+  /// from scratch. This can't be a true one-tap action: there's no backend
